  "dialogue": [
    {
      "line_id": 1,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Hi Julia."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 2,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Hi Bob. Thought about "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q1"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 3,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Which one? The presentations are scheduled for next month!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 4,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " you and I are working on-to demonstrate density, buoyancy and the compression of gases."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 5,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 6,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Well, it's not supposed to be. It'll be part of the 'Making Science Simple' series "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q4"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " And we have to be ready to demonstrate "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q5"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 7,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Oh, well, ...simple...you say."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 8,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Yes, not just the concept "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q6"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " We have to use cheap, readily available, common items-"
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q7"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 9,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "I remember something about using recycled or "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q8"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " if possible...Anything portable that we can bring into the lab."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 10,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "That's right."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 11,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Well, "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q9"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 12,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "What about the classic Cartesian diver?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 13,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Is that the same as a Cartesian devil? "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q10"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " the famous French physicist-Rene Descartes?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 14,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Yes, a long time ago superstitious people labelled it that because they couldn't comprehend "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q11"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " it demonstrated; they thought it was black magic."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 15,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "How shall we do it?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 16,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "By keeping it as "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q12"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " as possible."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 17,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "So, to start with...?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 18,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Open your pencil case and "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q13"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " Mmm, you haven't got any..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 19,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Any what?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 20,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Paper clips."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 21,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Oh, there are lots of them in "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q14"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " They slip off my papers and collect in the bottom. Look, here's half a dozen."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 22,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "But they're "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q15"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "-I want little ones-small, vinyl-covered multi-coloured ones."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 23,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Oh, I've got one or two of them too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 24,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Great. And...if we look around, especially on the floor, "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q16"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " See? Here."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 25,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "What else do we need?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 26,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "A small rubber band."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 27,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Well, "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q17"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 28,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "No, not that kind. Let's go and ask Tara."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 29,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Why?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 30,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Those really small coloured bands "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q18"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 31,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Hey, Tara?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 32,
      "speaker": "Tara",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Yes?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 33,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Have you got any spare rubber bands like the ones you fasten your hair with?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 34,
      "speaker": "Tara",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Oh, heaps, a whole packet full-"
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q19"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 35,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Terrific....So far it hasn't "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q20"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " What now?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 36,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Let's go and rummage through the recycling bins beside Joe's Mini-market."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 37,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "What for?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 38,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "We want a 2-litre "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q21"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " with lid."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 39,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Hey, I draw the line at "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q22"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " and we're also not likely to find one with a lid."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 40,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Well, go into the store and buy 2 litres of soft drink."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 41,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "What flavour?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 42,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "It doesn't matter "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q23"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": ", just make sure it comes in a clear P. E. T. bottle."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 43,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Where are you going?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 44,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "To the cafeteria behind the Resource Centre."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 45,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "What for?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 46,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q24"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 47,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "I can get them from the shop when I buy the drink."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 48,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "No, I've seen theirs. They're the waxed paper ones. We need clear plastic and I know "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q25"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " I'll also see if I can get a tall plastic cup from there."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 49,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Good luck. Meet you back here in 5 minutes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 50,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Maybe longer because I want to go over to my locker and get a wire "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q26"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 51,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Right. Have we got everything now?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 52,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "I think so. "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q27"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " for most things so don't worry if this doesn't work the first time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 53,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Okay. Assembly. Step 1."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 54,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Take a straw and fold it in two. No, not like that these plastic ones are quite hard to fold-try pinching it in the middle-that should make it easier to bend. You may even have to bite it"
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q28"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " you want a sharp crease but you don't want to break it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 55,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "How's this?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 56,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Good; now, second step. Wrap a rubber band several times "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q29"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " to hold them together."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 57,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Then?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 58,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Add weight to the diver."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 59,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "So, this straw "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q30"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 60,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Yes. See how I'm pulling the outside end of "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q31"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " out a bit? Now, hook the part I bent out into the rubber band that's holding the straw together. No, not that way-"
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q32"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " That's right, "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q33"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " Now, hook two or three more paper clips on. "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q34"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " The idea is to get the diver to be almost all the way submerged, but not quite. We can put it in "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q35"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " to test it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 61,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Mmm ...What do you think? Too buoyant? Add another paper clip?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 62,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "I think so. Okay, onto the next step. Have you "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q36"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 63,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Not quite."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 64,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "What do you mean?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 65,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Well, it's not quite empty."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 66,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Pour some into this cup "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q37"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " Good. Now fill the bottle with water "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q38"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " and we'll gently lower the diver in. Great-now "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q39"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 67,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "And then?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 68,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "The final step is the demonstration of our experiment-you will see that when I squeeze the bottle, the diver... sinks and when I let it go, the diver...rises."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 69,
      "speaker": "Bob",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "When you squeeze, the air bubble trapped in the straw compresses and the water rushes in making it heavier "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q40"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": " And the reverse happens when you release the bottle. "
        },
        {
          "type": "blank",
          "id": "audio7_q41"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": 70,
      "speaker": "Julia",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Oh, that? If our experiment didn't work the first time and our diver stayed on the bottom, we'd have had to fish it out with a piece of wire or a hook of some kind. It's best to be prepared."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
